            "cat4_a10": "",
            "category_5_name": "CONTACT US",
            "cat5_q1": "HOW CAN I CONTACT THE ISOUA TEAM?",
            "cat5_a1": "Feel free to reach out to us at any time—we’re here for questions, product recommendations, and feedback. Just send us a note through our contact form. \n\nOur customer service team is available via email Monday-Friday, 9 am-7 pm IST, excluding holidays. We will respond to your inquiry within 2 business days. Please refrain from sending additional emails on your current thread, as this will result in your message being sent to the back of the queue.",
